; Verified PMOS-input 5T OTA generator.
; Full tested artifact: 5T_OTA_Generator_PMOS_INPUT_FINAL.il
; Cadence Virtuoso IC6.1.7 / TSMC65.
; Architecture: PMOS M1/M2 input pair, NMOS M3/M4 mirror load,
; PMOS M5 tail. Uses short local stubs + same net labels.
; No physical G-D/B-D/G-B connections.
; This repository copy is the tested reference artifact from the
; working Cadence session.
